  "adventure.pocket.title": "Bonus die",
  "adventure.pocket.desc": "Win a fight or open a chest to get one. Spend 1 to nudge a roll by \xB11, or 2 to throw a 1\u20133 and pick the face yourself. The pocket holds three \u2014 a die that finds it full pays points instead.",
  "adventure.nudge.title": "Nudge the roll?",
