  "settings.legal.title": "Privacy Policy & Terms",
  "settings.legal.body": 'Developer: Aiwa Int\nContact: aiwainit2023@gmail.com\n\nThis game is distributed on the CrazyGames platform. By playing it you agree to the points below.\n\n1. DATA COLLECTED\n\u2022 Advertising (CrazyGames Ads). Ads are served ONLY through the CrazyGames Ads SDK. To deliver and measure ads, CrazyGames and its advertising partners may process technical data such as your device type, browser, IP address (for approximate location) and ad interactions. This is handled by CrazyGames under their own Privacy Policy (crazygames.com/privacy). We do not use any other ad network.\n\u2022 Saved progress. Your progress and settings are stored locally in your browser and, on CrazyGames, may be synced via CrazyGames cloud save so you can continue across devices.\n\n2. WHAT WE DO NOT DO\n\u2022 We never ask for your name, email or any personal account inside the game.\n\u2022 We do not sell your personal data.\n\u2022 We use no third-party ad network other than CrazyGames.\n\n3. CHILDREN\nThe game is suitable for a general audience. It does not knowingly collect personal information from children. Advertising follows the CrazyGames platform policies.\n\n4. YOUR CHOICES\nYou can clear locally stored data at any time by clearing your browser storage. For data processed on the CrazyGames platform, see the CrazyGames Privacy Policy.\n\n5. TERMS OF USE\nThis game is provided "as is", for entertainment, without warranties of any kind. We are not liable for any loss arising from its use. All assets are used under their respective licenses. These terms may change; continued play means you accept the current version.\n\n6. CONTACT\nQuestions about this policy: Aiwa Int \u2014 aiwainit2023@gmail.com',
  // Platform-neutral document for link-free web portals (NO_EXTERNAL_LINKS, e.g. GamePix, GD): no URLs, no
  // other platform named, and NO contact email — GD's Forbidden Checklist bans contact details and website
  // URLs inside the game itself. Picked in render/settings-overlay.
  "settings.legal.bodyWeb": 'Developer: Aiwa Int\n\n1. DATA COLLECTED\n\u2022 Anonymous gameplay analytics (GameAnalytics, in some versions), used only to improve the game.\n\u2022 Online multiplayer. Only if you start an online match, a relay service carries the room code, your in-game name, avatar and moves between the two players.\n\u2022 Saved progress. Your progress and settings are stored locally in your browser.\n\u2022 Ads, if shown, are served by the platform hosting the game under its own privacy policy.\n\n2. WHAT WE DO NOT DO\n\u2022 We never ask for your name, email or any personal account.\n\u2022 We do not sell your personal data.\n\n3. CHILDREN\nThe game is suitable for a general audience and does not knowingly collect personal information from children.\n\n4. YOUR CHOICES\nYou can clear locally stored data at any time by clearing your browser storage.\n\n5. TERMS OF USE\nThis game is provided "as is", for entertainment, without warranties of any kind. We are not liable for any loss arising from its use. All assets are used under their respective licenses.\n',
  // The SAME document for the Poki build — Poki bans Google products outright and reviews any other
  // analytics case-by-case, so that build ships none at all; its one external request is Ably, which
  // only opens when the player starts an online match. Picked by `isPoki` in render/settings-overlay.
  "settings.legal.bodyPoki": 'Developer: Aiwa Int\nContact: aiwainit2023@gmail.com\n\nThis game is distributed on the Poki platform. By playing it you agree to the points below.\n\n1. DATA COLLECTED\n\u2022 Advertising (Poki). Ads are served ONLY through the Poki SDK. To deliver and measure ads, Poki and its advertising partners may process technical data such as your device type, browser, IP address (for approximate location) and ad interactions. This is handled by Poki under their own Privacy Statement (poki.com/en/c/privacy-statement). We do not use any other ad network.\n\u2022 Online multiplayer (Ably). Only if you start an online match, the game connects to Ably Realtime (ably.com) to relay the duel between the two players. What travels: a randomly generated room code, your in-game display name, your chosen avatar and the moves of the match. Ably processes connection data such as your IP address under its own privacy policy. If you never open an online match, no such connection is made.\n\u2022 Saved progress. Your progress and settings are stored locally in your browser and are not sent anywhere.\n\u2022 Display name. If you are signed in to Poki, the game shows your Poki username; otherwise it generates a random callsign on your device. The name cannot be typed in and is never collected by us.\n\n2. WHAT WE DO NOT DO\n\u2022 This version contains no analytics of any kind \u2014 no Google Analytics, no GameAnalytics, no in-house tracking.\n\u2022 We never ask for your name, email or any personal account inside the game.\n\u2022 We do not sell your personal data.\n\u2022 We use no third-party ad network other than Poki.\n\n3. CHILDREN\nThe game is suitable for a general audience. It does not knowingly collect personal information from children. Advertising follows the Poki platform policies.\n\n4. YOUR CHOICES\nYou can clear locally stored data at any time by clearing your browser storage. You can avoid the only external connection the game makes by not starting an online match. For data processed on the Poki platform, see the Poki Privacy Statement.\n\n5. TERMS OF USE\nThis game is provided "as is", for entertainment, without warranties of any kind. We are not liable for any loss arising from its use. All assets are used under their respective licenses. These terms may change; continued play means you accept the current version.\n\n6. CONTACT\nQuestions about this policy: Aiwa Int \u2014 aiwainit2023@gmail.com',
